    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Sherry Property Sales and Letting Agents are excited to present this fantastic 3 bedroom bungalow for sale. This 3 bedroom property is situated in Hilltop, Ardee, and located just five minutes away to the lovely village of Ardee. This property which is c.94m2 was built c.1980. This bright and spacious property which is resting on a site of circa 0.13 hectares (0.3 acres) is an ideal choice for families or first time buyers. This is an opportunity not to be missed.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises: entrance hall, living room, kitchen/dining room, utility room, 3 bedrooms and family bathroom. This property is heated by Oil Fired Central Heating and has double glazed windows. This property also comes with a generous amount of space for car parking. There are large walled and hedge lined gardens to the front of the property and hedge lined gardens to the rear of the property. The property is secured by gates. The accommodation also comes with the added bonus of a garage which can be used for car parking, storage facilities or a workshop.\r\n\r\nHilltop is located c.1.3km from Ardee Town Centre – which is just 5 minutes away. Ardee is also a very popular commuter town due to its excellent transport links. The property enjoys convenient access to both the N2 and M1 Motorways offering excellent connectivity for your daily commute.  In Ardee, you will find all amenities close by including crèches, primary schools, secondary schools, shops, restaurants, pubs, sporting facilities, churches and bus routes. This property would be ideal for a first time buyer or families."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall:\t\t        Carpet flooring, Coving at ceiling\r\n\r\nLiving Room:\t\t\tCarpet flooring, coving at ceiling, feature fireplace, blinds\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room:\tTiled flooring, coving at ceiling, fully fitted wall and floor units, tiled splash back, integrated appliances\r\n\r\nUtility Room:\t                Tiled flooring\r\n\t\t\t\r\nBedroom 1:\t\t\tBuilt in wardrobe, double glazed windows, blinds \r\n\r\nBedroom 2:\t\t\tCarpet flooring, double glazed windows, blinds\r\n\r\nBedroom 3:\t\t\tCarpet flooring, built in wardrobe, double glazed windows, blinds\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom:\t\tTiled flooring, Bath, tiled around bath, WC, WHB, storage unit\r\n\r\nGardens:\t\t\t        There are large walled and hedge lined gardens to the front of the property and hedge lined gardens to the rear of the \r\n                                        property\r\n\r\nGarage:                           There is a detached garage with the property which can be used for car parking , storage or as a workshop"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "\tExcellent location \r\n\tBright and spacious living accommodation\r\n\tNot overlooked to front or rear of property\r\n\tSitting on c.0.3acres\r\n\tOil fired Central Heating\r\n\tDouble Glazed Windows\r\n\tFeature fireplace\r\n\tDriveway with excellent car parking facilities and fully gated \r\n\tLarge walled and hedge lined gardens to front of property and hedged lined garden to rear of property\r\n\tGarage \r\n\tClose to all local amenities\r\n\tOnly minutes from Ardee town centre"
      },
